---
import Demo from '../../components/Demo.astro'
import Section from '../../components/Section.astro'
import Trend from '../../demos/charts/Trend.tsx'
import trendCode from '../../demos/charts/Trend.tsx?raw'
import ComponentDoc from '../../layouts/ComponentDoc.astro'
---

<ComponentDoc
  entry="trend-chart"
  lead="A month day by day as a line, with its running total dotted against a second axis. The legend turns each series off and on; hovering, touching or the arrow keys read a day."
>
  <Demo title="Daily shipments in April" code={trendCode}><Trend client:visible /></Demo>

  <Section slot="guidance" title="Usage" id="usage">
    <ul class="prose">
      <li>One series, and its running total when the month’s sum matters. Days still to come are null and leave the line open.</li>
      <li>Label three days on the axis: the first, the middle and the last.</li>
      <li>The width follows its container; the height is a prop.</li>
    </ul>
  </Section>

  <ul slot="accessibility" class="prose">
    <li>The chart is a group with a live region: the day being read is announced with both values.</li>
  </ul>
</ComponentDoc>
